## Revenue Streams (in order of expected contribution)

1. **Enterprise Determinism Layer** (60-75% of total revenue)  
   - DGK Certification + Auditor Hub access  
   - Full ASIOS determinism deployment  
   - Highest willingness to pay due to regulatory and legal risk mitigation

2. **Creator / Studio Tier** (15-20%)  
   - Full-length film production capability  
   - Extremely high perceived value for creators and small studios

3. **Academic & University Licenses** (10-15%)  
   - Growing fast due to academic integrity requirements and funding mandates

4. **Pro Consumer Tier** (5-10%)  
   - Volume play that builds brand and feeds higher tiers

